  designNotes: 'Mechanics test: Doomed on either side. It wipes other statuses and
    blocks new ones, gives +1 permanent Attack each Dawn (it stays on the card),
    then Last Rites strike the opposite slot even if the creature Cannot Act, and
    it dies for real.'
